  "title": "Best practices for building strong mobile biometric authentication",
  "summary": "Strong authentication of mobile users is an increasingly important issue for enterprises and commercial entities. While it is likely impossible to have perfect authentication security, taking care while engineering an authentication scheme can result in lowering risk to an acceptable level. It is also important to balance security concerns with user convenience so users are willing to use a strong system.",
